{"seq":4,"slug":"sealed-hierarchies","title":"密封层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/type-system/sealed-hierarchies","wordCount":769,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"密封层级\">密封层级</h1><p>密封类（sealed class）和密封接口（sealed interface）是 Kotlin 中用于表示受限类层次结构的强大工具。它们确保所有子类型在编译时可知，从而实现穷尽检查（exhaustive checking）和精确的领域建模。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>密封层级的核心是<strong>把可穷尽性交给类型系统</strong>：所有直接子类型限定在同一模块内声明，编译器因此能在 <code>when</code> 表达式中做穷尽检查，遗漏分支即编译失败。它把「这个集合有哪些可能取值」从运行时的约定提升为编译期的约束，适合状态机与结果建模。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"密封类基础\">密封类基础</h2><p>密封类限制了其直接子类型只能在同一包内定义（Kotlin 1.5+ 放宽至同一模块）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"sealed class Result&lt;out T&gt; {&#10;    data class Success&lt;T&gt;(val data: T) : Result&lt;T&gt;()&#10;    data class Error(val message: String, val cause: Throwable? = null) : Result&lt;Nothing&gt;()&#10;    data object Loading : Result&lt;Nothing&gt;()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class Result&#x3C;out T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Success&#x3C;T>(val data: T) : Result&#x3C;T>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Error(val message: String, val cause: Throwable? = null) : Result&#x3C;Nothing>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object Loading : Result&#x3C;Nothing>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>密封类本身是抽象的，不能直接实例化。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"when-表达式穷尽检查\">when 表达式穷尽检查</h2><p>密封类与 <code>when</code> 配合使用时，编译器可以确保所有分支都已覆盖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun &lt;T&gt; handleResult(result: Result&lt;T&gt;): String = when (result) {&#10;    is Result.Success -&gt; &quot;成功: ${result.data}&quot;&#10;    is Result.Error -&gt; &quot;错误: ${result.message}&quot;&#10;    is Result.Loading -&gt; &quot;加载中...&quot;&#10;    // 无需 else 分支，编译器已知所有子类型&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun &#x3C;T> handleResult(result: Result&#x3C;T>): String = when (result) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is Result.Success -> \"成功: ${result.data}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is Result.Error -> \"错误: ${result.message}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is Result.Loading -> \"加载中...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 无需 else 分支，编译器已知所有子类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果添加了新的密封子类型但忘记更新 <code>when</code> 表达式，编译器会报错。这在大型项目中是极其重要的安全保障。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"密封接口\">密封接口</h2><p>Kotlin 1.5+ 引入了密封接口，提供了更灵活的建模能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"sealed interface UiEvent&#10;sealed interface NavigationEvent : UiEvent&#10;&#10;data class Click(val id: String) : UiEvent&#10;data class Swipe(val direction: String) : UiEvent&#10;data class Navigate(val route: String) : NavigationEvent&#10;data object Back : NavigationEvent\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface UiEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface NavigationEvent : UiEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Click(val id: String) : UiEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Swipe(val direction: String) : UiEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Navigate(val route: String) : NavigationEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data object Back : NavigationEvent</span></span></code></pre></div><p>密封接口的优势在于一个类可以实现多个密封接口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"sealed interface Loggable&#10;sealed interface Serializable&#10;&#10;data class UserAction(val name: String) : Loggable, Serializable\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface Loggable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class UserAction(val name: String) : Loggable, Serializable</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[sealed interface UiEvent]&#10;    B[sealed interface NavigationEvent]&#10;    C[Click]&#10;    D[Swipe]&#10;    E[Navigate]&#10;    F[Back]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt;|继承| A&#10;    C --&gt;|实现| A&#10;    D --&gt;|实现| A&#10;    E --&gt;|实现| B&#10;    F --&gt;|实现| B\">graph TD\n    A[sealed interface UiEvent]\n    B[sealed interface NavigationEvent]\n    C[Click]\n    D[Swipe]\n    E[Navigate]\n    F[Back]\n\n    B --&gt;|继承| A\n    C --&gt;|实现| A\n    D --&gt;|实现| A\n    E --&gt;|实现| B\n    F --&gt;|实现| B</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"密封类-vs-枚举\">密封类 vs 枚举</h2><p>两者都表示有限的类型集合，但适用场景不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th><code>enum class</code></th>\n<th><code>sealed class</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实例数量</td>\n<td>每个值有且仅有一个实例</td>\n<td>每个子类可有多个实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构造参数</td>\n<td>所有值共享相同参数结构</td>\n<td>每个子类可有不同的属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>无状态或共享状态模板</td>\n<td>每个子类可携带不同数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层次结构</td>\n<td>扁平</td>\n<td>可嵌套形成树状结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td><code>name</code>/<code>ordinal</code> 简单映射</td>\n<td>需要多态序列化支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 枚举：每个方向都是相同结构的单例&#10;enum class Direction { NORTH, SOUTH, EAST, WEST }&#10;&#10;// 密封类：每种形状携带不同的属性&#10;sealed class Shape {&#10;    data class Circle(val radius: Double) : Shape()&#10;    data class Rectangle(val width: Double, val height: Double) : Shape()&#10;    data class Triangle(val a: Double, val b: Double, val c: Double) : Shape()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun area(shape: Shape): Double = when (shape) {&#10;    is Shape.Circle -&gt; Math.PI * shape.radius * shape.radius&#10;    is Shape.Rectangle -&gt; shape.width * shape.height&#10;    is Shape.Triangle -&gt; {&#10;        val s = (shape.a + shape.b + shape.c) / 2&#10;        Math.sqrt(s * (s - shape.a) * (s - shape.b) * (s - shape.c))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 枚举：每个方向都是相同结构的单例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum class Direction { NORTH, SOUTH, EAST, WEST }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 密封类：每种形状携带不同的属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class Shape {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Circle(val radius: Double) : Shape()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Rectangle(val width: Double, val height: Double) : Shape()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Triangle(val a: Double, val b: Double, val c: Double) : Shape()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun area(shape: Shape): Double = when (shape) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is Shape.Circle -> Math.PI * shape.radius * shape.radius</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is Shape.Rectangle -> shape.width * shape.height</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is Shape.Triangle -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val s = (shape.a + shape.b + shape.c) / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Math.sqrt(s * (s - shape.a) * (s - shape.b) * (s - shape.c))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"层次化建模\">层次化建模</h2><p>密封类支持多层嵌套，形成精确的领域模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"sealed class PaymentMethod {&#10;    sealed class Card : PaymentMethod() {&#10;        data class Credit(val number: String, val limit: Double) : Card()&#10;        data class Debit(val number: String, val balance: Double) : Card()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    sealed class Digital : PaymentMethod() {&#10;        data class Alipay(val account: String) : Digital()&#10;        data class WeChatPay(val openId: String) : Digital()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    data class Cash(val currency: String) : PaymentMethod()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun describe(method: PaymentMethod): String = when (method) {&#10;    is PaymentMethod.Card.Credit -&gt; &quot;信用卡: ${method.number}&quot;&#10;    is PaymentMethod.Card.Debit -&gt; &quot;借记卡: ${method.number}&quot;&#10;    is PaymentMethod.Digital.Alipay -&gt; &quot;支付宝: ${method.account}&quot;&#10;    is PaymentMethod.Digital.WeChatPay -&gt; &quot;微信支付: ${method.openId}&quot;&#10;    is PaymentMethod.Cash -&gt; &quot;现金 (${method.currency})&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class PaymentMethod {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sealed class Card : PaymentMethod() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data class Credit(val number: String, val limit: Double) : Card()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data class Debit(val number: String, val balance: Double) : Card()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sealed class Digital : PaymentMethod() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data class Alipay(val account: String) : Digital()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data class WeChatPay(val openId: String) : Digital()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Cash(val currency: String) : PaymentMethod()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun describe(method: PaymentMethod): String = when (method) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is PaymentMethod.Card.Credit -> \"信用卡: ${method.number}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is PaymentMethod.Card.Debit -> \"借记卡: ${method.number}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is PaymentMethod.Digital.Alipay -> \"支付宝: ${method.account}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is PaymentMethod.Digital.WeChatPay -> \"微信支付: ${method.openId}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is PaymentMethod.Cash -> \"现金 (${method.currency})\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[PaymentMethod]&#10;    B[Card]&#10;    C[Digital]&#10;    D[Cash]&#10;    E[Credit]&#10;    F[Debit]&#10;    G[Alipay]&#10;    H[WeChatPay]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; A&#10;    C --&gt; A&#10;    D --&gt; A&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    G --&gt; C&#10;    H --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[PaymentMethod]\n    B[Card]\n    C[Digital]\n    D[Cash]\n    E[Credit]\n    F[Debit]\n    G[Alipay]\n    H[WeChatPay]\n\n    B --&gt; A\n    C --&gt; A\n    D --&gt; A\n    E --&gt; B\n    F --&gt; B\n    G --&gt; C\n    H --&gt; C</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"密封类与状态机\">密封类与状态机</h2><p>密封类非常适合表示有限状态机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"sealed class DownloadState {&#10;    data object Idle : DownloadState()&#10;    data class Downloading(val progress: Int) : DownloadState()&#10;    data class Paused(val progress: Int) : DownloadState()&#10;    data class Completed(val filePath: String) : DownloadState()&#10;    data class Failed(val error: Throwable) : DownloadState()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun transition(state: DownloadState, action: String): DownloadState = when (state) {&#10;    is DownloadState.Idle -&gt; when (action) {&#10;        &quot;start&quot; -&gt; DownloadState.Downloading(0)&#10;        else -&gt; state&#10;    }&#10;    is DownloadState.Downloading -&gt; when (action) {&#10;        &quot;pause&quot; -&gt; DownloadState.Paused(state.progress)&#10;        &quot;complete&quot; -&gt; DownloadState.Completed(&quot;/downloads/file.zip&quot;)&#10;        &quot;fail&quot; -&gt; DownloadState.Failed(RuntimeException(&quot;网络错误&quot;))&#10;        else -&gt; state&#10;    }&#10;    is DownloadState.Paused -&gt; when (action) {&#10;        &quot;resume&quot; -&gt; DownloadState.Downloading(state.progress)&#10;        else -&gt; state&#10;    }&#10;    is DownloadState.Completed -&gt; state&#10;    is DownloadState.Failed -&gt; when (action) {&#10;        &quot;retry&quot; -&gt; DownloadState.Downloading(0)&#10;        else -&gt; state&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class DownloadState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object Idle : DownloadState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Downloading(val progress: Int) : DownloadState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Paused(val progress: Int) : DownloadState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Completed(val filePath: String) : DownloadState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Failed(val error: Throwable) : DownloadState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun transition(state: DownloadState, action: String): DownloadState = when (state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is DownloadState.Idle -> when (action) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"start\" -> DownloadState.Downloading(0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else -> state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is DownloadState.Downloading -> when (action) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"pause\" -> DownloadState.Paused(state.progress)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"complete\" -> DownloadState.Completed(\"/downloads/file.zip\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"fail\" -> DownloadState.Failed(RuntimeException(\"网络错误\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else -> state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is DownloadState.Paused -> when (action) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"resume\" -> DownloadState.Downloading(state.progress)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else -> state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is DownloadState.Completed -> state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is DownloadState.Failed -> when (action) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"retry\" -> DownloadState.Downloading(0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else -> state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>优先使用密封接口</strong>：当不需要共享状态时，密封接口更灵活</li>\n<li><strong>搭配 <code>when</code> 表达式</strong>：充分利用穷尽检查，避免 <code>else</code> 分支</li>\n<li><strong>配合 <code>data class</code>/<code>data object</code></strong>：自动获得 <code>equals</code>、<code>hashCode</code>、<code>toString</code></li>\n<li><strong>合理控制层级深度</strong>：超过三层嵌套会降低可读性</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Kotlin 1.7+ 中，密封类的 <code>when</code> 穷尽检查已扩展为语句（statement）也强制要求，不仅限于表达式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>密封类</strong>限制子类型在同一模块内定义，使编译器能进行穷尽检查</li>\n<li><strong>密封接口</strong>更灵活，允许一个类实现多个密封接口</li>\n<li>与 <strong>枚举</strong>的区别：密封类的子类可以携带不同属性、拥有多个实例</li>\n<li>密封类支持<strong>层次化嵌套</strong>，适合复杂领域建模</li>\n<li>典型应用场景包括：Result 类型、UI 状态、支付方式、状态机等</li>\n<li>搭配 <code>when</code> 的穷尽检查是密封类最重要的编译时安全保障</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"密封层级","id":"密封层级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"密封类基础","id":"密封类基础"},{"level":2,"text":"when 表达式穷尽检查","id":"when-表达式穷尽检查"},{"level":2,"text":"密封接口","id":"密封接口"},{"level":2,"text":"密封类 vs 枚举","id":"密封类-vs-枚举"},{"level":2,"text":"层次化建模","id":"层次化建模"},{"level":2,"text":"密封类与状态机","id":"密封类与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内联类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/type-system/inline-classes"},"next":{"title":"协程基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/coroutine-fundamentals"}}